g hoại bên trong con người.", "status": "approved", "thank_count": 14, "score": 0.00426152, "new_score": 0.15305716, "customer_id": 16668718, "comment_count": 0, "rating": 5, "images": [{"id": 1147667, "full_path": "https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/review/9c/7a/0b/41966cb142096ff61bf2517c69d70a4a.jpg", "status": "approved"}], "thanked": false, "created_at": 1598271050, "created_by": {"id": 16668718, "name": "Lê Hoàng", "full_name": "Lê Hoàng", "region": null, "avatar_url": "https://platform-lookaside.fbsbx.com/platform/profilepic/?asid=674496716631079&height=200&width=200&ext=1585837497&hash=AeRHRiFgW0Ce0jGv", "created_time": "2020-03-03 21:25:37", "group_id": 8, "purchased": true, "purchased_at": 1588082364, "contribute_info": {"id": 16668718, "name": "Lê Hoàng", "avatar": "https://platform-lookaside.fbsbx.com/platform/profilepic/?asid=674496716631079&height=200&width=200&ext=1585837497&hash=AeRHRiFgW0Ce0jGv", "summary": {"joined_time": "Đã tham gia 7 năm", "total_review": 91, "total_thank": 256}}}, "suggestions": [], "attributes": ["Mua từ nhà bán Tiki Trading"], "product_attributes": [], "spid": 8886008, "is_photo": true, "seller": {"id": 1, "name": "Tiki Trading", "logo": "https://vcdn.tikicdn.com/ts/seller/ee/fa/a0/98f3f134f85cff2c6972c31777629aa0.png"}, "product_id": 8886007, "timeline": {"review_created_date": "2020-08-24 19:10:50", "delivery_date": "2020-05-02 14:40:24", "current_date": "2026-09-08 12:44:39", "content": "Đã dùng 4 tháng", "explain": "Khi viết đánh giá, khách hàng đã dùng sản phẩm 4 tháng."}, "comments": [], "vote_attributes": {"agree": [], "disagree": []}, "delivery_rating": []}, {"id": 17242650, "title": "Cực kì hài lòng", "content": "Hàng giao nhanh, đóng gói ổn áp. Sách không bị gì nên cho 5 sao hihi", "status": "approved", "thank_count": 0, "score": 44.44444444, "new_score": 0.15380206, "customer_id": 27092078, "comment_count": 0, "rating": 5, "images": [{"id": 3742110, "full_path": "https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/review/3e/41/f8/fdd1b93d3f515a9